/**
 * swe.ch12.l2 — "Graphical Displays of Data Sets
 * عرض البيانات بيانيًا"
 * Aligned with SWE ch12 s3 (12.3 Graphical Displays of Data Sets,
 * pp.318-321: data sets, scales of measurement, bar charts, Gantt charts,
 * hill charts).
 * All expression is original — a paraphrase of the CC BY-SA 4.0 source, never
 * a verbatim translation.
 * SIMULATED-RENDERER pattern (established in PY4E ch16): matplotlib is NOT
 * available in the sandbox — charts are TEXT. Every runnable field builds
 * ASCII bar charts ('#'), a sparkline and fixed-bin histograms with plain
 * string repetition and %-formatting. Deterministic only.
 */
