        en: 'The text histogram for our data (cfds is given): for each bin in bins print one line formatted [%2d,%2d) | %s %d — where %2d pads the number to width 2 for alignment, the bar is a repeat of \u2019#\u2019 per count, then the count. Bins are half-open: lo <= v < hi. Finally print counts: %s with the list of counts. Expected: [ 0, 5) | ## 2, then [ 5,10) | ##### 5, then [10,15) | ### 3, then [15,20) |  0 (an EMPTY bar for zero!), then [20,25) | # 1, then counts: [2, 5, 3, 0, 1].',
