            en: 'The average is computable yet statistically illegal: addition assumes equal spacing between levels, which ordinal scales do not have. A release with one Critical and five Lows can be worse than one with ten Mediums even when the mean says otherwise — hence severity is summarized with per-level counts and a median.',
          },
