            en: 'Uphill is \u201cfiguring it out\u201d: open questions and undecided design; downhill is \u201cjust execution\u201d: unknowns resolved, routine left. A task counter looks healthiest right before the unlisted unknown blows up — the hill makes uncertainty visible alongside quantity, in language about the work, not the people.',
          },
