            en: 'Bar length is an encoding of value: truncating the axis breaks proportion and turns a difference of 3 into a mountain. Our text renderer cannot cheat at all: \u2019#\' * ticks never yields a negative bar, and zero is an empty bar. A tool that cannot lie trains the eye in honesty.',
          },
