            en: 'The scale determines legal operations before taste does. Addition assumes equal spacing and a meaningful zero — both absent from nominal and ordinal data. Five critical defects are not \u201cthe same as\u201d five trivial ones: the distribution is the data, and averaging it destroys what it claims to summarize.',
          },
