            en: 'Reordering categories harms a bar chart not at all; reordering bins destroys a histogram. Quick test: does the axis have continuous quantitative meaning? Defect type: no. Defect count: yes. And bin width is a decision: too wide hides structure, too narrow turns it into noise.',
